# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Claude Code local (machine-specific) settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# Environment files. .env.production and .env.example are intentionally
# tracked (publishable Supabase + VAPID keys for the build pipeline; the
# template). Everything else is local-only and must never be committed —
# private dev creds, service-role keys, etc.
.env
.env.development
.env.test
.env.staging

# Apple credentials and code-signing artifacts. APNs auth keys (.p8),
# distribution certs (.p12 / .cer), provisioning profiles, and any raw
# private keys belong only on machines / Supabase secrets / Xcode Cloud
# secrets — never in the repo. Catches accidental "stash this here for
# a sec" commits.
*.p8
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
*.cer
*.mobileprovision
